### Créer un tracteur
POST http://localhost:8080/tractors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "x": 0,
  "y": 0,
  "direction": "N"
}

### Tourner à droite (remplacer {id} par l'id retourné à la création)
POST http://localhost:8080/tractors/tractor-1/instructions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instruction": "D"
}

### Avancer de 3 points
POST http://localhost:8080/tractors/tractor-1/instructions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instruction": "A(3)"
}

### Positionner le tracteur
POST http://localhost:8080/tractors/tractor-1/instructions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instruction": "S(2,3,N)"
}

### Instruction invalide
POST http://localhost:8080/tractors/tractor-1/instructions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instruction": "X"
}

### Instruction vide
POST http://localhost:8080/tractors/tractor-1/instructions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instruction": ""
}

### Body JSON malformé
POST http://localhost:8080/tractors/tractor-1/instructions
Content-Type: application/json

not json

### Tracteur inconnu -> 404
POST http://localhost:8080/tractors/does-not-exist/instructions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instruction": "D"
}

### Flux SSE de toutes les positions
GET http://localhost:8080/tractors/stream
Accept: text/event-stream
